1018                         ; NEED TO PAD TO FFF8 for 1KB SIMON BINARY suitable for 
1019                         ; 32yte rom loader on MON1...
1020                         ; .lst file shows the above JMP xxxx at FFE8/9/A, so...
1021 ffeb 01                  NOP ; Pad FFEB
1022 ffec 01                  NOP ; Pad FFEC
1023 ffed 01                  NOP ; Pad FFED
1024 ffee 01                  NOP ; Pad FFEE
1025 ffef 01                  NOP ; Pad FFEF
1026 fff0 01                  NOP ; Pad FFF0
1027 fff1 01                  NOP ; Pad FFF1
1028 fff2 01                  NOP ; Pad FFF2
1029 fff3 01                  NOP ; Pad FFF3
1030 fff4 01                  NOP ; Pad FFF4
1031 fff5 01                  NOP ; Pad FFF5
1032 fff6 01                  NOP ; Pad FFF6
1033 fff7 01                  NOP ; Pad FFF7
1034                         
